        notes: The High Septon at the time of AFFC. Described as an old man and frail. The 'sparrows' — the humblest of men, fierce in their piety — follow him. Not to be confused with the later High Sparrow who replaces him. Listed in the AFFC appendix under the people of King's Landing.
